There is no function called 'dir' in the marray package. Note that it is
the "marray" package not the "Marray". R is case sensitive.

I think the following should suffice

   fname <- list.files( path=datadir, pattern="\\.spot" )

BTW, dir() is an alias for list.files() and I prefer to use the latter
as I think it has a clearer meaning.

